0 // Its flat underside is 16 LDU down (two plates above the bottom of the curve), like 1750's.
0 // Two stud sockets there, one under each stud position, so a 1 x 2 plate fits underneath.
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=F] [caps=one] [secs=R 6 4] [pos=0 16 0] [grid=1 2 0 -20]
